From: Allen Lin <mingchih.lin@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 08:05:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [impv] Adjust invalid-login logging

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]

Summary:
 - Align with DMTF Redfish Message Registry Guide (2026-04-03).
 - Stop logging invalid usernames to prevent log spam during mass login attacks.

Reference:
 - https://jira.navman.co.nz/jira/browse/OFDT-168
 - https://www.dmtf.org/sites/default/files/standards/documents/DSP2065_2026.1.pdf
---
